              This  option  was new in Netpbm 10.71 (June 2015).  Before that,
              ppnnmmttooppnngg never generates an sRGB chunk.


       --mmooddttiimmee==""[_y_y]_y_y_-_m_m_-_d_d _h_h_:_m_m_:_s_s""
