              Use --nnooffiilltteerr, --ssuubb, --uupp, --aavvgg, and --ppaaeetthh in current Netpbm.


       --nnooffiilltteerr

       --ssuubb

       --uupp

       --aavvgg

       --ppaaeetthh Each  of  these  options permits ppnnmmttooppnngg to use one type of row
              filter.  ppnnmmttooppnngg chooses whichever of the permitted filters  it
