              ffuunnccttiioonn.  Do not confuse this with  the  Netpbm  common  option
              --vveerrssiioonn,  which  causes the program to display version informa‐
              tion about the Netpbm library and do nothing else.

              You can't really use this option in a program that invokes  ppnnmm‐‐
              ttooppnngg  and  needs to know which version it is.  Its function has
